spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:22:Out of scope:
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:41:- **Batch Pull Request**: A pull request opened from the Loop-Start Branch after Orchestration Idle.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:49:- **REQ-004**: If the Loop-Start Branch is a Protected Trunk Branch, Symphony MUST NOT run automated Task Branch Integration.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:52:- **REQ-007**: The update operation SHOULD merge the current Loop-Start Branch into the Task Branch instead of rebasing the Task Branch.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:56:- **REQ-011**: Any integration merge commit MUST be clearly identified as integration-only and MUST NOT include new agent-authored file changes beyond the merge result.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:58:- **REQ-013**: Batch Pull Request creation MUST wait for Orchestration Idle and MUST NOT open while any task is in Merge Attention Status or unresolved orchestration attention.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:61:- **CON-001**: Symphony MUST NOT auto-merge task work into a Protected Trunk Branch.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:62:- **CON-002**: Symphony MUST NOT force-push Task Branches as part of integration.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:63:- **CON-003**: Direct merge commits on the Loop-Start Branch SHOULD NOT be used for this strategy.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:64:- **GUD-001**: The implementation SHOULD serialize final Loop-Start Branch updates to avoid concurrent writes to the same branch checkout.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:103:- **AC-006**: Given any task has Merge Attention Status, When Orchestration Idle would otherwise open a Batch Pull Request, Then no Batch Pull Request opens.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:109:- **Frameworks**: OCaml Alcotest.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:152:- **PLT-001**: OCaml backend - Implements orchestration and Git integration.
spec/spec-architecture-task-branch-integration.md:156:- **COM-001**: ADR coverage - Runtime semantic changes require an ADR.
